1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,320
Thousands of zombies

2
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:02,660
are staring at his light.

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:03,660
So how do you turn off

4
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,060
a lamp that won't turn off?

5
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,630
The override is locked.

6
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,040
The key is gone.

7
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:08,660
So he finds

8
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,670
the breaker box.

9
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,650
One switch. One click.

10
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:13,220
The lamp dies.

11
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:14,720
The island goes dark.

12
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,950
But so does the radio.

13
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,930
And the radar.

14
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:19,550
He can't see

15
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,560
the shore anymore.

16
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,290
The longest night

17
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,210
of his life.

18
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:23,420
He waits for dawn,

19
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,900
listening to the waves.

20
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,040
Then the waves go quiet.

21
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:30,420
The tide is dropping. Fast.

22
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,690
And something rises

23
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:32,610
from the sea floor.

24
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:35,050
A long line of pale sand.

25
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,020
Straight to the island.

26
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,610
A causeway. Forty feet wide.

27
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,530
Ankle deep.

28
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,190
Zombies can't swim.

29
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,430
But they can walk.

30
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,160
Rule number one just broke.

31
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,090
He checks the tide chart.

32
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,250
Low tide at five forty-seven.

33
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,460
Two hours from now,

34
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,540
the sea will be gone.

35
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,290
The shore is already moving.

36
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:55,100
The first one steps onto the sand.

37
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:59,490
Part three. The wall has a door. Follow for part three.
